# DevOps

## Monorepo (personal-cluster)

- Apps vivem em `apps/<slug>/`; manifests em `infra/<slug>/`.
- Nova app: `./scripts/new-app.sh <slug>` na raiz do monorepo.
- CI/CD gerado em `.github/workflows/<slug>-{ci,deploy}.yaml`.
- Imagem: `ghcr.io/kaehm/personal-cluster/<slug>-web:sha-xxxxxxx`.

## Local / CI

- `make check` = format + lint + typecheck + test-coverage + build.
- CI roda em **PRs** com paths `apps/<slug>/**`.
- Deploy na **master** → build GHCR + auto-commit do manifest.

## Observabilidade (cluster)

Env vars no Deployment (template em `templates/boilerplate/infra/web-app.yaml`):

- `LOG_LEVEL`, `OTEL_SERVICE_NAME`, `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`
- Service annotations: `prometheus.io/scrape`, `prometheus.io/port`, `prometheus.io/path`

Endpoint OTLP: `http://alloy.monitoring.svc.cluster.local:4318`

## Docker

- `output: standalone` in `next.config.ts`; multi-stage `Dockerfile`.
- `.env.local` com credenciais do Supabase Cloud para `docker compose up`.

